  "description": "Netiqo.Framework is a lightweight and extensible .NET framework designed to simplify the creation of custom HTTP servers. It supports route-based request handling, both static and dynamic, with native support for SSL, async handlers, and declarative routing via attributes.\n\nFeatures:\n- Lightweight TCP-based HTTP server\n- Declarative routes using attributes or JSON/XML configuration\n- Support for all standard HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, etc.)\n- SSL support with X.509 certificates\n- Automatic response chunking and file serving\n- Cross-platform IPv4 detection\n- Simple, embeddable design\n\nIdeal for embedded systems, rapid API prototyping, or custom networking scenarios where full-fledged ASP.NET hosting is not required.\n\nCommercial use allowed. License must be retained. Reverse engineering is prohibited. See LICENSE file for details.",
